    "mm_pdp_deepdives_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive-group\">\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive\">\n    <img class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive-img\" src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/menmansion-verlauf-gold-aleppo.png?v=1776688595&width=1445\" alt=\"Aleppo Seife\">\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive-body\">\n      \n      <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive-title\">Aleppo Seife</h2>\n      <p class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive-text\">Traditionell hergestellt auf Basis von Oliven- und Lorbeeröl. Reinigt gründlich, ohne die Haut auszutrocknen - ein Produkt statt drei.</p>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-deepdive-checks\">\n        <span><span class=\"mm-pdp-check\">✓</span>Entfernt Schmutz und überschüssigen Talg</span>\n        <span><span class=\"mm-pdp-check\">✓</span>Naturreine Öle, keine synthetischen Tenside</span>\n        <span><span class=\"mm-pdp-check\">✓</span>Trocknet die Haut nicht aus</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_herkunft_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft\">\n  <img class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-img\" src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/menmansion-verlauf-gold-aleppo.png?v=1776688595&width=1200\" alt=\"Die Essenz des Orients\">\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-body\">\n    \n    <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-title\">Die Essenz des Orients</h2>\n    <p class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-text\">Im Jahr 800 n. Chr. wussten Männer bereits, was funktioniert. In den alten Manufakturen von Aleppo, einer Stadt, die Händlern auf der Seidenstraße als Referenz galt, wurde eine Seife hergestellt, deren Rezeptur sich bis heute nicht verändert hat.</p>\n    <details class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-more\">\n      <summary><span class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-more-open\">Mehr lesen</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-more-close\">Weniger anzeigen</span></summary>\n      <p class=\"mm-pdp-herkunft-text\">Olivenöl und Lorbeeröl, sorgfältig gemischt, monatelang gereift, von Hand gestempelt. Neu definiert für den Gentleman, der auf Qualität besteht.</p>\n    </details></div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_ingredients_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredients\">\n  \n  <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-ingredients-title\">Die Magie dahinter</h2>\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredients-grid\">\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-card\">\n      <img class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-img\" src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/1_e639d59c-2556-48b4-aef6-c172181c5d16.png?v=1775740856&width=300\" alt=\"Olivenöl\">\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-body\">\n        <h3 class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-title\">Olivenöl</h3>\n        <p class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-text\">Reinigt sanft und nährt die Haut mit natürlichen Lipiden und Vitamin E.</p>\n        <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-origin\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-origin-label\">Herkunft</span>Erstpressung aus Aleppo</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-card\">\n      <img class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-img\" src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/2_6eaa1df9-a9cf-4713-9a4f-17c9a426f1ed.png?v=1775740856&width=300\" alt=\"Lorbeeröl\">\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-body\">\n        <h3 class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-title\">Lorbeeröl</h3>\n        <p class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-text\">Antibakteriell, beruhigend, entzündungshemmend. Das Herzstück der Formel.</p>\n        <div class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-origin\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-ingredient-origin-label\">Herkunft</span>Traditionell gewonnen aus syrischen Lorbeerbäumen in Aleppo</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_routine_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{{ 'mm-pdp-routine3.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n<section class=\"mm-r3\" id=\"mm-pdp-routine-anchor\">\n  <div class=\"mm-r3-inner\">\n\n    <header class=\"mm-r3-head\">\n      <h2 class=\"mm-r3-title\">Die Routine. <span>In 2 Steps.</span></h2>\n      <p class=\"mm-r3-sub\">Reinigung mit Aleppo-Seife, Pflege mit Tallow - ohne unnötige Schritte</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <ol class=\"mm-r3-track\" id=\"mm-r3-track\">\n      <li class=\"mm-r3-card\">\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-media\">\n          <img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/IMG_1680.jpg?v=1775741337&width=800\" alt=\"Reinigen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-fade\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-num\">01</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-body\">\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-row\"><h3>Reinigen</h3></div>\n          <p>Reinige dein Gesicht mit der Aleppo-Seife und lauwarmem Wasser, um Schmutz und überschüssigen Talg zu entfernen. Die Haut wird sanft vorbereitet - ohne auszutrocknen.</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"mm-r3-card\">\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-media\">\n          <img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/tallow_6717dc4e-91c8-4004-9713-4f01e1b18f4b.png?v=1776688595&width=800\" alt=\"Pflegen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-fade\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-num\">02</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-body\">\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-row\"><h3>Pflegen</h3></div>\n          <p>Danach die Tallow Gesichtscreme auftragen und einmassieren. Die hautähnlichen Lipide stärken die Hautbarriere und ziehen vollständig ein.</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"mm-r3-dots\" id=\"mm-r3-dots\" hidden>\n      <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"0\" aria-label=\"Schritt 1\"><span></span></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"1\" aria-label=\"Schritt 2\"><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var track = document.getElementById('mm-r3-track');\n  var dots  = document.getElementById('mm-r3-dots');\n  if (!track || !dots || !track.children.length) return;\n  var btns = dots.querySelectorAll('button');\n  function stepWidth() {\n    if (track.children.length > 1) return track.children[1].offsetLeft - track.children[0].offsetLeft;\n    return track.children[0].getBoundingClientRect().width;\n  }\n  function sync() {\n    var scrollable = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth > 8;\n    dots.hidden = !scrollable;\n    if (!scrollable) return;\n    var step = stepWidth();\n    if (!step) return;\n    var i = Math.min(btns.length - 1, Math.round(track.scrollLeft / step));\n    for (var n = 0; n < btns.length; n++) btns[n].setAttribute('aria-current', n === i ? 'true' : 'false');\n  }\n  for (var b = 0; b < btns.length; b++) {\n    btns[b].addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var el = track.children[+this.dataset.i];\n      if (el) track.scrollTo({ left: el.offsetLeft - track.offsetLeft, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    });\n  }\n  track.addEventListener('scroll', sync, { passive: true });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', sync);\n  sync();\n})();\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_reviews_header_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- liquid\n  assign rating = product.metafields.loox.avg_rating\n  assign review_count = product.metafields.loox.num_reviews\n  if rating != blank\n    assign rating_display = rating | replace: '.', ','\n    assign rounded = rating | round\n  else\n    assign rating_display = '4,8'\n    assign review_count = 398\n    assign rounded = 5\n  endif\n-%}\n<div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews\">\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-head\">\n    <div>\n      \n      <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-title\">Was Männer über uns sagen</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-summary\">\n      <span class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-avg\">{{ rating_display }}</span>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-summary-body\">\n        <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-stars\">{% for i in (1..5) %}{% if i <= rounded %}★{% else %}<span style=\"color:var(--mm-graphite)\">★</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>\n        <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-total\">{{ review_count }} verifizierte Bewertungen</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-more-head\">\n    \n    <span class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-swipe-hint\">Wischen →</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div\n    class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-grid\"\n    data-mm-reviews-grid\n    data-product-id=\"{{ product.id }}\"\n    data-fallback-image=\"{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }}\"\n    data-fallback-product-name=\"{{ product.title | escape }}\"\n  ></div>\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-more-wrap\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-cta mm-pdp-reviews-more\" data-mm-reviews-more hidden>Mehr Bewertungen</button>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_faq_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mm-pdp-faq\">\n  \n  <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-faq-title\">Deine Fragen. Unsere Antworten.</h2>\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion\">\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Wofür eignet sich die Aleppo-Seife?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Für Gesicht, Körper und Rasur - sie ersetzt Gesichtsreiniger, Rasierseife und Körperseife in einem einzigen Produkt.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Welche Inhaltsstoffe sind enthalten?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Nur zwei: Olivenöl (Olea Europaea) und Lorbeeröl (Laurus Nobilis), nach traditioneller Rezeptur handgemacht in Aleppo, Syrien.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Wie lange hält ein Stück Seife?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Bei täglicher Anwendung 6–8 Wochen.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Wie lange dauert der Versand?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Versand aus unserem Lager in Rottenburg, Deutschland - innerhalb von 1–2 Werktagen nach Auftragseingang. Lieferzeit in Deutschland, Österreich und der Schweiz: 2–4 Werktage. Kostenloser Versand ab 60 € Bestellwert.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Was, wenn mir das Produkt nicht gefällt?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Du hast 30 Tage Zeit, das Produkt zurückzuschicken - ohne Wenn und Aber. Das ist unser Versprechen.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_sticky_cta_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{{ 'mm-pdp-sticky-cta.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n{%- liquid\n  assign sc_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant\n  assign sc_price = sc_variant.price\n  assign sc_compare = sc_variant.compare_at_price\n-%}\n<div class=\"mm-sc\" id=\"mm-sc\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"mm-sc-info\">\n    <span class=\"mm-sc-title\">{{ product.title }}</span>\n    <span class=\"mm-sc-prices\">\n      <span class=\"mm-sc-price\">{{ sc_price | money_without_currency }} €</span>\n      {%- if sc_compare > sc_price -%}\n        <span class=\"mm-sc-compare\">{{ sc_compare | money_without_currency }} €</span>\n      {%- endif -%}\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--primary mm-sc-cta\" id=\"mm-sc-cta\">Bundle wählen</button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var bar = document.getElementById('mm-sc');\n  // In der Theme-Vorschau liegt die Shopify-Leiste unten drueber und verdeckt die\n  // Sticky-Bar komplett. Nur dort nach oben versetzen, auf dem Shop bleibt sie unten.\n  if (bar && /shopifypreview\\.com$/.test(location.hostname)) bar.classList.add('is-preview');\n  var cta = document.getElementById('mm-sc-cta');\n  if (!bar || !cta) return;\n\n  // Ab hier soll die Leiste erscheinen: die Vorher/Nachher-Section.\n  var trigger = document.querySelector('.mm-pdp-ba') || document.querySelector('.mm-pdp-principle');\n  // Ziel des Klicks: die Bundle-Auswahl in der Buybox (Koala-Widget),\n  // ersatzweise der Kaufbereich.\n  function target() {\n    return document.querySelector('koala-quantity-breaks-embed')\n      || document.querySelector('koala-quantity-breaks-app-block')\n      || document.querySelector('.koala-deal')\n      || document.querySelector('.product-form__buttons')\n      || document.querySelector('.product__info-container');\n  }\n\n  var ticking = false;\n  function sync() {\n    ticking = false;\n    if (!trigger) return;\n    var show = trigger.getBoundingClientRect().top < window.innerHeight * 0.6;\n    bar.classList.toggle('is-visible', show);\n    bar.setAttribute('aria-hidden', show ? 'false' : 'true');\n  }\n  function onScroll() {\n    if (ticking) return;\n    ticking = true;\n    window.requestAnimationFrame(sync);\n  }\n\n  cta.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    var el = target();\n    if (!el) return;\n    var header = document.querySelector('.section-header, sticky-header, header');\n    var offset = header ? header.getBoundingClientRect().height + 12 : 12;\n    var y = el.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.pageYOffset - offset;\n    window.scrollTo({ top: Math.max(0, y), behavior: 'smooth' });\n  });\n\n  window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', onScroll);\n  sync();\n})();\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    }
  },
